Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

No there's no built-in parallelization with a n.cluster argument. These permutations can use so much memory that doing it in parallel requires care.

Yes you can combine multiple batches with c() or rbind().

karl

